    "svgcontent": "<svg width=\"1600\" height=\"960\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:svg=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:html=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><g><title>Layer 1</title><rect id=\"svg_486af772-ef0d-4474-94d5-6742300ca696\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1600\" height=\"960\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#141c26\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"0\"/><text id=\"svg_78facaa0-5c8f-4fb5-bcfc-0ae8b0b29269\" x=\"20\" y=\"34\" font-size=\"24\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" fill=\"#e8eef5\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-weight=\"bold\" stroke-width=\"0\" xml:space=\"preserve\">LOAD SHEDDING</text><text id=\"svg_c9bba737-7c10-4685-a203-a6268b1cbe1a\" x=\"20\" y=\"58\" font-size=\"13\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" fill=\"#8fa3b8\" text-anchor=\"start\" stroke-width=\"0\" xml:space=\"preserve\">Switch a unit to SHED to cut its power. The light shows the real state: green = running, red = shed / off. A unit switched back on restarts after a 3 s lock-out.</text><g id=\"HXB_155ea9cc-2054-455c-9225-472c664eeba2\" type=\"svg-ext-html_button\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" font-size=\"13\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" stroke=\"#000000\"><rect id=\"svg_07ec909e-8f11-41c0-b948-6e35345b3e7f\" x=\"1144\" y=\"16\" width=\"140\" height=\"26\" fill=\"#3059AF\" stroke-width=\"0\" stroke=\"#ffffff\"/><foreignObject id=\"H-HXB_18caa982-fc0a-47b2-b55a-b3db4658759d\" x=\"1144\" y=\"16\" width=\"140\" height=\"26\"><BUTTON id=\"B-HXB_45097b09-9b25-4043-925c-e2481a9eca67\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 100%; vector-effect: non-scaling-stroke; background-color: #3059AF; color: #ffffff;\" class=\"md-btn  md-btn-raised\">Overview</BUTTON></foreignObject></g><g id=\"HXB_1d810a59-12ef-4ec4-b07b-e9e2fe9184bf\" type=\"svg-ext-html_button\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" font-size=\"13\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" stroke=\"#000000\"><rect id=\"svg_b42b8a13-d879-4961-abdf-06deacd6eb28\" x=\"1292\" y=\"16\" width=\"140\" height=\"26\" fill=\"#3059AF\" stroke-width=\"0\" stroke=\"#ffffff\"/><foreignObject id=\"H-HXB_d5bb72ac-67a4-43dc-9e97-cc0cd12d0803\" x=\"1292\" y=\"16\" width=\"140\" height=\"26\"><BUTTON id=\"B-HXB_cb5133cd-4275-431d-afc6-d7521c958f5e\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 100%; vector-effect: non-scaling-stroke; background-color: #3059AF; color: #ffffff;\" class=\"md-btn  md-btn-raised\">Energy</BUTTON></foreignObject></g><g id=\"HXB_8ade3051-0cbc-48b5-87f1-66183394c091\" type=\"svg-ext-html_button\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" font-size=\"13\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" stroke=\"#000000\"><rect id=\"svg_2c221fa3-2c38-44b1-9a7c-3ad1e3afa7e9\" x=\"1440\" y=\"16\" width=\"140\" height=\"26\" fill=\"#3059AF\" stroke-width=\"0\" stroke=\"#ffffff\"/><foreignObject id=\"H-HXB_9a3dd7ff-f181-4e4a-82f0-7758a6971914\" x=\"1440\" y=\"16\" width=\"140\" height=\"26\"><BUTTON id=\"B-HXB_c143c91b-a498-4041-af72-22b4142b09ae\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 100%; vector-effect: non-scaling-stroke; background-color: #3059AF; color: #ffffff;\" class=\"md-btn  md-btn-raised\">Mechanism setup</BUTTON></foreignObject></g><rect id=\"svg_8eecb5cb-5136-4794-83ca-228a06a51096\" x=\"20\" y=\"74\" width=\"380\" height=\"66\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#202b38\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"0\"/><text id=\"svg_62487d39-3fb6-482a-a697-d6ee12806ae3\" x=\"36\" y=\"96\" font-size=\"12\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" fill=\"#8fa3b8\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-weight=\"bold\" stroke-width=\"0\" xml:space=\"preserve\">TOTAL POWER (kW)</text><g id=\"VAL_fcdf180a-abf3-4619-8705-168f4df5d478\" type=\"svg-ext-value\" fill=\"#4da3ff\" font-size=\"26\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" stroke-width=\"0\" text-anchor=\"start\"><text id=\"VAL_dbcf1c66-3d8e-4895-af76-67c1735854d5\" x=\"36\" y=\"126\" fill=\"#4da3ff\" font-size=\"26\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" text-anchor=\"start\" stroke-width=\"0\" xml:space=\"preserve\">#0.0</text></g><rect id=\"svg_f7ee4edd-7515-4747-bf21-af6a4bc99851\" x=\"413\" y=\"74\" width=\"380\" height=\"66\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#202b38\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"0\"/><text id=\"svg_bc377525-15e6-4717-8ada-dec35e832ca1\" x