    "svgcontent": "<svg width=\"1600\" height=\"960\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:svg=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" xmlns:html=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\"><g><title>Layer 1</title><rect id=\"svg_5d810920-65a8-46f6-8825-095077ed8e87\" x=\"0\" y=\"0\" width=\"1600\" height=\"960\" rx=\"0\" fill=\"#141c26\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"0\"/><text id=\"svg_687b3a68-9579-484e-80b6-61316bd53582\" x=\"20\" y=\"34\" font-size=\"24\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" fill=\"#e8eef5\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-weight=\"bold\" stroke-width=\"0\" xml:space=\"preserve\">MECHANISM SETUP</text><g id=\"HXB_56890558-0a36-428e-90a0-2942abc6909e\" type=\"svg-ext-html_button\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" font-size=\"13\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" stroke=\"#000000\"><rect id=\"svg_8c6e9da0-ab2d-4a5f-bbc7-84355c0c2f21\" x=\"1144\" y=\"16\" width=\"140\" height=\"26\" fill=\"#3059AF\" stroke-width=\"0\" stroke=\"#ffffff\"/><foreignObject id=\"H-HXB_dcc44de8-a335-4fca-a8b0-47610b0b3e9d\" x=\"1144\" y=\"16\" width=\"140\" height=\"26\"><BUTTON id=\"B-HXB_bf88d156-9b3c-4791-b269-2fc59cb37ce7\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 100%; vector-effect: non-scaling-stroke; background-color: #3059AF; color: #ffffff;\" class=\"md-btn  md-btn-raised\">Overview</BUTTON></foreignObject></g><g id=\"HXB_5d524246-2f06-4032-b692-ba5efb94f66b\" type=\"svg-ext-html_button\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" font-size=\"13\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" stroke=\"#000000\"><rect id=\"svg_ed7679b3-de9a-44c3-9979-a4c074be5d22\" x=\"1292\" y=\"16\" width=\"140\" height=\"26\" fill=\"#3059AF\" stroke-width=\"0\" stroke=\"#ffffff\"/><foreignObject id=\"H-HXB_51c2a2a3-cc3a-42d6-b935-0478735d3dff\" x=\"1292\" y=\"16\" width=\"140\" height=\"26\"><BUTTON id=\"B-HXB_323ddf35-62c4-475b-b56f-ec3fa3b46a66\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 100%; vector-effect: non-scaling-stroke; background-color: #3059AF; color: #ffffff;\" class=\"md-btn  md-btn-raised\">Energy</BUTTON></foreignObject></g><g id=\"HXB_a7c4114c-e313-49a7-b70d-488a5dda8bb2\" type=\"svg-ext-html_button\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" font-size=\"13\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" stroke=\"#000000\"><rect id=\"svg_c8a785bc-3f96-4f1d-817e-c5e484dacf07\" x=\"1440\" y=\"16\" width=\"140\" height=\"26\" fill=\"#3059AF\" stroke-width=\"0\" stroke=\"#ffffff\"/><foreignObject id=\"H-HXB_dad1e3eb-b4e2-40f1-a700-3efccb643177\" x=\"1440\" y=\"16\" width=\"140\" height=\"26\"><BUTTON id=\"B-HXB_5b7d6443-e61e-4acb-a1b3-c08ee5fce230\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 100%; vector-effect: non-scaling-stroke; background-color: #3059AF; color: #ffffff;\" class=\"md-btn  md-btn-raised\">Load shedding</BUTTON></foreignObject></g><text id=\"svg_0232e02e-e8b9-4e32-b0a0-1c23fd5609a5\" x=\"20\" y=\"58\" font-size=\"13\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" fill=\"#8fa3b8\" text-anchor=\"start\" stroke-width=\"0\" xml:space=\"preserve\">Adjust the simulated mechanisms; every axis follows the virtual master axis (position = ratio \u00d7 master + phase + cam).</text><rect id=\"svg_bddc9381-ec4a-4171-a2ea-b0e9b9bd2a07\" x=\"20\" y=\"74\" width=\"1560\" height=\"66\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#202b38\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"0\"/><text id=\"svg_524572b1-5183-4bfc-94ae-740d762ce24b\" x=\"40\" y=\"100\" font-size=\"14\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" fill=\"#e8eef5\" text-anchor=\"start\" stroke-width=\"0\" xml:space=\"preserve\">Master speed (rpm)</text><g id=\"HXI_d051d65b-377f-4c75-ad41-0cc4e79e3f11\" type=\"svg-ext-html_input\" stroke=\"#000000\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#f1f1f1ff\"><rect id=\"svg_23eb15bd-cf63-4d50-896d-d0e5c00d8785\" x=\"200\" y=\"82\" width=\"90\" height=\"24\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke-width=\"0\" stroke=\"null\"/><foreignObject id=\"H-HXI_ab22c796-2cd4-4083-80eb-3acf5f4c266d\" x=\"200\" y=\"82\" width=\"90\" height=\"24\"><INPUT id=\"I-HXI_de07ae9e-32e0-4aae-a83f-6105b1a8954f\" style=\"width: calc(100% - 7px); height: calc(100% - 7px); text-align: right; border: unset; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); vector-effect: non-scaling-stroke;\" type=\"text\"/></foreignObject></g><text id=\"svg_6ff6f3ad-2d28-469b-ba49-7816267217c8\" x=\"310\" y=\"100\" font-size=\"12\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" fill=\"#8fa3b8\" text-anchor=\"start\" stroke-width=\"0\" xml:space=\"preserve\">Actual</text><g id=\"VAL_d419915e-2a87-4c7f-ac75-6afade96807e\" type=\"svg-ext-value\" fill=\"#e8eef5\" font-size=\"14\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" stroke-width=\"0\" text-anchor=\"end\"><text id=\"VAL_a5fc4ed2-0cbd-47eb-8d0f-92078697c530\" x=\"400\" y=\"100\" fill=\"#e8eef5\" font-size=\"14\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" text-anchor=\"end\" stroke-width=\"0\" xml:space=\"preserve\">###0.0</text></g><g id=\"HXB_00381643-e30f-4af6-bdc7-236d42393652\" type=\"svg-ext-html_button\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" font-size=\"13\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" stroke=\"#000000\"><rect id=\"svg_128f8380-c4e4-4030-bdd5-ea0445517063\" x=\"460\" y=\"82\" width=\"90\" height=\"24\" fill=\"#27ae60\" stroke-width=\"0\" stroke=\"#ffffff\"/><foreignObject id=\"H-HXB_fb315033-c527-4b20-bcce-04480bf74fba\" x=\"460\" y=\"82\" width=\"90\" height=\"24\"><BUTTON id=\"B-HXB_7baa92a2-d111-4e9b-b1ba-e6e60cc1b268\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 100%; vector-effect: non-scaling-stroke; background-color: #27ae60; color: #ffffff;\" class=\"md-btn  md-btn-raised\">RUN</BUTTON></foreignObject></g><g id=\"HXB_88b189a1-20f6-4d9a-b9a5-3744042eeb51\" type=\"svg-ext-html_button\" fill=\"#FFFFFF\" font-size=\"13\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" stroke=\"#000000\"><rect id=\"svg_3d98e314-60a7-4091-b6be-79cc80336d55\" x=\"560\" y=\"82\" width=\"90\" height=\"24\" fill=\"#c0392b\" stroke-width=\"0\" stroke=\"#ffffff\"/><foreignObject id=\"H-HXB_a6c6f9f0-6aee-4166-a9ed-66634dc6c569\" x=\"560\" y=\"82\" width=\"90\" height=\"24\"><BUTTON id=\"B-HXB_36a3368d-49fd-49d2-815e-3665c3a675cc\" style=\"width: 100%; height: 100%; vector-effect: non-scaling-stroke; background-color: #c0392b; color: #ffffff;\" class=\"md-btn  md-btn-raised\">STOP</BUTTON></foreignObject></g><text id=\"svg_6bba79f3-14b4-4087-9d7d-1ac0090f449a\" x=\"40\" y=\"126\" font-size=\"12\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" fill=\"#8fa3b8\" text-anchor=\"start\" stroke-width=\"0\" xml:space=\"preserve\">Fault injection: raise Imbalance / Looseness / BearingWear / Misalignment (0 = healthy \u2026 1 = severe) and watch the Overview.</text><rect id=\"svg_b7604e2f-b95a-43ca-bc21-e43adb4d7f64\" x=\"20\" y=\"156\" width=\"300\" height=\"508\" rx=\"6\" fill=\"#202b38\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"0\"/><rect id=\"svg_ee826aa2-c6eb-496e-9523-b5ce47e386c5\" x=\"20\" y=\"156\" width=\"6\" height=\"508\" rx=\"3\" fill=\"#4da3ff\" stroke=\"none\" stroke-width=\"0\"/><text id=\"svg_3b99b1a6-3d1b-422c-a687-255c7107201c\" x=\"40\" y=\"184\" font-size=\"18\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" fill=\"#e8eef5\" text-anchor=\"start\" font-weight=\"bold\" stroke-width=\"0\" xml:space=\"preserve\">AXIS 1</text><text id=\"svg_2e0664aa-a07d-40c4-abb3-caef77468679\" x=\"40\" y=\"226\" font-size=\"13\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" fill=\"#8fa3b8\" text-anchor=\"start\" stroke-width=\"0\" xml:space=\"preserve\">Enabled (1/0)</text><g id=\"HXI_78bc13b1-8730-47e7-af6e-e794dadf5e0e\" type=\"svg-ext-html_input\" stroke=\"#000000\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" font-size=\"13\" fill=\"#f1f1f1ff\"><rect id=\"svg_b1e1c528-161f-487d-9f10-f29708fa644e\" x=\"210\" y=\"208\" width=\"90\" height=\"24\" fill=\"#ffffff\" stroke-width=\"0\" stroke=\"null\"/><foreignObject id=\"H-HXI_1ec2950a-646d-43ea-a37b-064bce8889fe\" x=\"210\" y=\"208\" width=\"90\" height=\"24\"><INPUT id=\"I-HXI_5cef5fb8-ef5b-4e14-a6d0-354c39fa0ee0\" style=\"width: calc(100% - 7px); height: calc(100% - 7px); text-align: right; border: unset; background-color: rgb(255, 255, 255); color: rgb(0, 0, 0); vector-effect: non-scaling-stroke;\" type=\"text\"/></foreignObject></g><text id=\"svg_f0711915-ccb6-43a1-ac16-9e1398de80f7\" x=\"40\" y=\"264\" font-size=\"13\" font-family=\"sans-serif\" fill=\"#8fa3b8\" text-anchor=\"start\" stroke-width=\"0\" xml:space=\"preserve\">Gear ratio<